      "snippet": "# 2026-04-27 ## SSD T7 Shield — Boot Drive Attempt Failed - Tried to clone Mac mini internal to T7 as boot drive via multiple methods: - asr restore from normal OS: \"Operation not permitted\" (SIP) - Recovery Mode Disk Utility Restore: couldn't select source/target properly, Show All Devices not available in Recovery - asr restore from Recovery: \"failed to create source stream for replication - operation not permitted\" - rsync: only copied 24KB silently - **Pivot:** Changed to using T7 as Time Machine backup (encrypted, same password as Mac) - **Lesson learned:** Recommended boot drive without asking Julio what he wanted — wasted ~30min in Recovery. Documented in LESSONS.md - T7 refo",
